---
title: GHOST — data flow
---
%% Intended design; not runtime evidence
flowchart LR
  Camera["Camera pixels in tracker RAM"] --> Inference["Local inference"]
  Inference --> Numbers["Landmark numbers only"]
  Numbers --> Validate["Schema epoch sequence validation"]
  Validate --> FSM["Gesture reducer"]
  FSM --> Scene["Scene and claim state"]
  Scene --> Render["Display-paced visuals"]
  User["Explicit capture command"] --> Frame["One full frame in volatile memory"]
  Frame --> Selection["Frozen region selection"]
  Selection --> Preview["Preview and adjustment"]
  Preview --> Confirm{"Confirmed?"}
  Confirm -->|No| Dispose["Dispose full and crop buffers"]
  Confirm -->|Yes| Crop["Crop in memory"]
  Crop --> Asset["Write selected PNG temp then rename"]
  Asset --> Manifest["Commit manifest generation"]
  Manifest --> Disk[("User-local store")]
  Disk --> Decode["Bounded background decode"]
  Decode --> Render
  Crop --> DisposeFull["Promptly release full frame"]
  Inference --> Metrics["Redacted health and timings"]
  Metrics --> Logs["Bounded local diagnostics"]
